{"step":2,"type":"command","purpose":"展示容量为一时的成功写入、429 原子回滚、版本 6 快照及水位线释放后的成功重试。","command":"python3 acceptance_checks/backpressure_acceptance.py demo 19211","displayStartedAt":"2026-10-04T10:12:07.631756+00:00","executedAt":"2026-10-04T10:12:10.317981+00:00","endedAt":"2026-10-04T10:12:18.555628+00:00","cwdBefore":"/mnt/d/ttk/ttk06/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/ttk06-011/a","cwdAfter":"/mnt/d/ttk/ttk06/verification/evaluation-rounds/1/record/ttk06-011/a","exitCode":0,"timedOut":false,"started":true,"processId":3379778,"processGroupId":3379778,"output":"\n=== health ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"service\": \"streammill\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"version\": \"0.1.0\"\n}\n\n=== create stream with max_open_windows=1 ===\nHTTP 201\n{\n  \"allowed_lateness_ms\": 0,\n  \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\",\n  \"window_ms\": 1000\n}\n\n=== initial pressure ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"available_windows\": 1,\n  \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n  \"open_windows\": 0,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\n=== accept event in window [0,1000) ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"dropped\": false,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\n=== reject event that would open [1000,2000) ===\nHTTP 429\n{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"stream_backpressured\",\n    \"message\": \"stream has no open window slots: demo-pressure\"\n  }\n}\n\n=== pressure remains full after rollback ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"available_windows\": 0,\n  \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n  \"open_windows\": 1,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\n=== version 6 snapshot after rejected write ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"format_version\": 6,\n  \"streams\": [\n    {\n      \"allowed_lateness_ms\": 0,\n      \"dedup_retention_ms\": null,\n      \"finalized\": [],\n      \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n      \"name\": \"demo-pressure\",\n      \"watermark_ms\": null,\n      \"window_ms\": 1000,\n      \"windows\": [\n        {\n          \"count\": 1,\n          \"sum\": 2,\n          \"window_end_ms\": 1000,\n          \"window_start_ms\": 0\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tables\": []\n}\n\n=== advance watermark to finalize and release the slot ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"finalized\": [\n    {\n      \"count\": 1,\n      \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\",\n      \"sum\": 2,\n      \"window_end_ms\": 1000,\n      \"window_start_ms\": 0\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\",\n  \"watermark_ms\": 1000\n}\n\n=== pressure after release ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"available_windows\": 1,\n  \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n  \"open_windows\": 0,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\n=== retry event after release ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"dropped\": false,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\n=== final pressure ===\nHTTP 200\n{\n  \"available_windows\": 0,\n  \"max_open_windows\": 1,\n  \"open_windows\": 1,\n  \"stream\": \"demo-pressure\"\n}\n\nDEMO PASS: rejection rolled back state; watermark release allowed the retry.\n","outputBase64":""}
